 @mainpage Welcome to the BrickGame_v1.0 Documentation

 This is the documentation for the "Tetris" project. Here you will find:
 - Main features.
 - How to run the project.
 - Details about the implementation.

 ## Game Description
 "BrickGame_v1.0" is a version of the classic "Tetris" game.
 Control keys:
 'KEY_UP' - rotate block
 'p' - pause
 'q' - end game
 'Esc' - quit from game when it's over
 'KEY_LEFT' - move block left
 'KEY_RIGHT' - move block right
 'SPACE' - fall block down

 ## Getting Started
 The program builds by using a Makefile

* `make install` - build the game into the 'install' directory 
* `make play` - build the game & play
* `make uninstall` - remove the program  
* `make dvi` - compile the documentation  
* `make run_dvi` - run the documentation  
* `make dist` - archive the project  
* `make test` - run unit tests  
* `make gcov_report` - generate a gcov-report as an HTML page  
* `make clean` - Remove unnecessary files

*/